CREATED:20261006T012545Z
DESCRIPTION:MSCA09|Conference|Hybrid\nLanguage: Bilingual\nIMG: https://dri
 ve.google.com/file/d/1YYMDbFQ28FZz3dQDwP8uI2yepZprGUC7/view?usp=sharing\nI
 MG: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Fzopc0iLI1l_F09HUm1KRhDpYCdChhhs/view
 ?usp=sharing\nIMG: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YyHT5t3iUXVsXR2NQqRx_l
 tvmWAnVTWJ/view?usp=sharing\n--\nSunday\, April 13 Area 09 Pre-Conference 
 Mock Conference 9:00am – 3:00pm PST (hybrid)\n\nSunday – April 13 – 
 8 am to 3 pm – Day 2 is the Pre-Conference Mock Conference Assembly (htt
 ps://docs.google.com/document/d/1IumG0J3vb89deTnAcKuiC4tsqqXAxQm5oZPj4XeNY
 WY/edit?usp=sharing) (English Agenda here).\n\nThe Pre-Mock Conference Wor
 kshop is a day where everyone involved has the fun opportunity to act like
  a delegate for the day and deliberate on agenda items “in committee” 
 – just like our delegate will do at the General Service Conference from 
 April 27 to May 3!\n\nGSRs and AA individuals are randomly assigned 1 of 6
  committees on the day of the event\, and DCMCs and Area Chairs are pre-as
 signed to 1 of the 6 committees that was discussed at the March Area Servi
 ce Committee. ( Reminder: GSRs who attended the March ASC and were assigne
 d a committee breakout will join the same committee on April 13). ( Please
  see the alternate delegate’s page for access to the workgroup assignmen
 ts ).\n\nThe outcome of this assembly will allow the delegate to know “ 
 Area 9’s group conscience” as discussed through the work group committ
 ees. Scribes of the Workgroup assignments will provide the committee’s r
 ecommendation via the Survey Monkey (https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/D65XWZ
 7) /Workgroup packet and share this information at the microphone. Workgro
 ups will also have the opportunity to discuss three pre-assigned General S
 ervice Conference inventory questions (English – HERE (https://docs.goog
 le.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScj_xJkUbXGcKs49o5nOdWazxV6a2YNOI3ZtLmK4iTrQHM1Bw/
 viewform?usp=header) Spanish – HERE (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1
 FAIpQLScqsHuVLq2p8acrggTpjNQYbwps8PicKqmWlNKN9IL1lMoQBQ/viewform?usp=heade
 r) ) and discuss the motion t o approve the Spanish Translation of The Pla
 in Language Big Book. (https://view.officeapps.live.com/op/view.aspx?src=h
 ttps%3A%2F%2Fmsca09aa.org%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FMotion-A-PL
 BB-in-Spanish.docx&wdOrigin=BROWSELINK)\n\nHosted by Alt Delegate\n\nPhysi
 cal location: Long Beach Community College: 4901 East Carson Street\, Long
  Beach\, CA\, United States\n\nDomingo – 13 de abril – 8 am a 3 pm –
  El día 2 es la Asamblea Simulada de Conferencia previa a la conferencia 
 (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gBjExWjrboa1kviLrEAUMvXaoSgqtcao/view?us
 p=drive_link) (Agenda en espanol aquí).\n\nEl Taller Pre-Simulado de la C
 onferencia es un día en el que todos los involucrados tienen la divertida
  oportunidad de actuar como delegados del día y deliberar sobre los temas
  de la agenda “en comité”\, ¡tal como lo hará nuestro delegado en l
 a Conferencia de Servicios Generales del 27 de abril al 3 de mayo!\n\nA lo
 s RSG y AA se les asigna aleatoriamente 1 de 6 comités el día del evento
 \, y los DCMC y los coordinadores de área están preasignados a 1 de los 
 6 comités que se discutieron en el Comité de Servicio de Área de marzo.
  ( Recordatorio: Los RSG que asistieron al ASC de marzo y se les asignó u
 n grupo de trabajo se unirán al mismo comité el 13 de abril). ( Consulte
  la página del delegado suplente para acceder a las tareas del grupo de t
 rabajo ).\n\n…
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T022711Z
LOCATION:Long Beach Community College\, 4901 East Carson Street\, Long Beac
 h\, CA 90808
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Area 09 Pre-Conference Mock Conference
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
