CREATED:20261006T012328Z
DESCRIPTION:MSCA09|Forum|Virtual\nLanguage: English\nWeb: http://www.praasa
 .org\nIMG: https://drive.google.com/file/d/18ZUAPvIRxjJ8kO1A2Xbx98ErWdGMV4x
 b/view?usp=sharing\nLink: PRAASAProgram-English-2022 https://drive.google.c
 om/file/d/1HjZ8daQ4-tj4TyxhcG7cynStJIHEKCCU/view?usp=sharing\nLink: PRAASAP
 rogram-Spanish-2022 https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Au9gXS7zDtt3vLsnD9JFIS
 0QEm_7rTt0/view?usp=sharing\n--\nPRAASA 2022 is going virtual! Please Join 
 Us March 4-6\, 2022\nRegister Online Now! (https://praasa.org/registration)
 \n**Important Update**\n\nIn the interest of safety\, unity\, and the commo
 n welfare of all the participating Areas in the region\, we have made the d
 ifficult but important decision to facilitate the entire PRAASA 2022 as a v
 irtual-only event. Though we wish we could see everyone in person\, we plan
  to do our best to carry the message through remote meeting technology to b
 ring the magic of PRAASA to all who wish to attend next March 4-6\, 2022.\n
 \nThank you for your patience as we have worked through this difficult proc
 ess. We are excited to see you all in the remote meetings next March!\n\nWH
 AT IS PRAASA? It is 3 day program which includes panel presentations on the
  General Service Conference theme and agenda items\, roundtable discussions
  for members to network with others who share their service position\, open
  mic sharing\, questions and Al-Anon participation.\n\nWHAT IS PRAASA’S PUR
 POSE? The purpose of PRAASA is to develop greater unity among the members\,
  groups\, and Areas of the Pacific Region\; to encourage the exchange of id
 eas and experiences\; and to provide an opportunity for members to discuss 
 pertinent aspects of AA. The Assembly and the PRAASA committee should alway
 s foster the Recovery\, Unity and Service legacies of AA.\n\nAN EXPERIENCE 
 YOU MUST NOT MISS! Come join over 1\,500 excited AA members from all over t
 he Pacific Region and be part of this unforgettable event. ASL and Spanish 
 translation available.\n\nPRINTED SCHEDULES: PRAASAProgram-English-2022 / P
 RAASAProgram-Spanish-2022
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T012329Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:PRAASA 2022
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
